WEBVTT

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:11.320
<i>GUNDAM</i>

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:11.320
<i>MOBILE SUIT</i>

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:17.870
<i>hoshi ga furishikiru penthouse de
In the penthouse that watches the stars fall...</i>

00:00:17.870 --> 00:00:24.040
<i>sora no ORUGO-RU hitori kiiteta
I listened to Heaven's music box...</i>

00:00:24.540 --> 00:00:30.460
<i>GARASU no RO-PU wo mekakushi de wataru
Walking, blindfolded, across a tight-rope of glass...</i>

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:37.090
<i>minna sabishii SA-KASU no kodomo sa
Everyone is like, the lonely child of the circus.</i>

00:00:38.850 --> 00:00:45.020
<i>hitori bocchi no kanashimi ni
The rope that creaks with the sadness of isolation...</i>

00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:50.770
<i>kishinda tsuna ga kokoro de yureteru...
...is still locked deep in my heart...</i>

00:00:58.200 --> 00:01:07.830
<i>yasashii me wo shita dareka ni aitai
I wish to meet the one who's eyes glow with warmth!</i>

00:01:14.710 --> 00:01:25.980
<i>sasayaite kureyo soba ni iruyotte Silent Voice
Whisper to me that you'll always be there by my side, Silent Voice.</i>

00:01:35.640 --> 00:01:38.060
The Argama wasn't the
only one that turned up.

00:01:38.060 --> 00:01:42.500
Glemy, who'd left Core 3,
began a rebellion against Haman!

00:01:42.500 --> 00:01:45.380
Thanks to that, Cicero could
escape from Core 3...

00:01:45.380 --> 00:01:48.360
and we made it back
to the Argama.

00:01:48.360 --> 00:01:50.110
And now Haman's forces...

00:01:50.110 --> 00:01:54.190
and Glemy's forces are
facing off in this sector.

00:01:56.460 --> 00:02:00.580
EMARY'S GLORY

00:02:14.620 --> 00:02:18.850
Kidnapping Mineva Zabi from
Haman at Core 3 is madness!

00:02:18.850 --> 00:02:22.780
If you get caught up in Haman
and Glemy's war, I can't cover for you!

00:02:22.780 --> 00:02:27.310
We should secure this airspace until
the Earth Federation fleet arrives!

00:02:27.310 --> 00:02:30.500
We have no idea when any
allies are going to get here!

00:02:30.500 --> 00:02:32.220
Deputy Captain Emary,

00:02:32.220 --> 00:02:35.240
with Haman distracted by Glemy,
we have a chance now, right?

00:02:35.240 --> 00:02:38.320
Judau, kidnapping
a child is just wrong!

00:02:38.320 --> 00:02:41.140
If we don't, we'll have
no way to hold back Haman!

00:02:41.140 --> 00:02:43.060
You don't win with idealism!

00:02:43.060 --> 00:02:44.030
But...!

00:02:44.030 --> 00:02:46.430
Understood. Go for it.

00:02:46.430 --> 00:02:48.510
But regardless of
the mission's success,

00:02:48.510 --> 00:02:50.820
get back here within the
time limit. Is that clear?

00:02:50.820 --> 00:02:53.510
That sounded just like what
Captain Bright, Miss Emary.

00:02:53.760 --> 00:02:57.280
Of course.
We're like one person.

00:02:57.280 --> 00:03:00.250
Oh? I'll tell his wife
you said that!

00:03:00.250 --> 00:03:01.910
Hey! What was that?!

00:03:01.910 --> 00:03:05.330
Double Zeta!
Judau Ashta, moving out!

00:03:07.070 --> 00:03:08.990
Roux Louka, moving out!

00:03:18.830 --> 00:03:22.060
Judau, if you tell on me,
you'll be sorry!

00:03:22.060 --> 00:03:23.700
Milly!

00:03:23.700 --> 00:03:25.200
Deputy Captain,

00:03:25.200 --> 00:03:27.960
the plan they came up with
is a good one.

00:03:27.960 --> 00:03:30.980
Y-You're right.
If this works out,

00:03:30.980 --> 00:03:33.680
I can go back to the moon and
see Captain Bright again!

00:03:43.840 --> 00:03:48.040
I'm disturbed that the Argama
is moving with Chara's fleet.

00:03:48.040 --> 00:03:52.630
I doubt they mind that
we're attacking Core 3.

00:03:52.630 --> 00:03:55.370
They likely intend to watch
our battle with Chara.

00:03:55.370 --> 00:03:57.600
So I'm to devote myself to
the battle with Chara, then?

00:03:57.600 --> 00:04:00.610
If the Argama makes a move,
I'll come and save you.

00:04:00.610 --> 00:04:02.310
Are you sure, Ple-Two?

00:04:02.310 --> 00:04:03.610
I am.

00:04:03.610 --> 00:04:05.680
Did you see the Quin
Mantha on the deck?

00:04:05.680 --> 00:04:07.720
It's for me, right?

00:04:07.720 --> 00:04:11.470
You know that you're the only
one capable of mastering it.

00:04:11.670 --> 00:04:15.010
Thank you, Glemy.
They won't beat me again.

00:04:15.240 --> 00:04:18.420
She really does seem reliable.

00:04:18.420 --> 00:04:21.890
Yes, we're ready
to bury Haman.

00:04:21.890 --> 00:04:25.180
We've already taken Axis.
What's left is to smash Chara's fleet,

00:04:25.180 --> 00:04:26.730
and then we'll declare war
against Haman herself!

00:04:26.960 --> 00:04:28.580
Sir!

00:05:23.070 --> 00:05:25.590
Aren't we moving in too close?

00:05:25.590 --> 00:05:28.840
If we don't back off a little, we'll get
caught in the battle, Deputy Captain!

00:05:28.840 --> 00:05:31.100
We can't let Glemy get to Core 3...

00:05:31.100 --> 00:05:33.700
while Judau and Roux
are infiltrating it!

00:05:33.700 --> 00:05:36.300
We have to be ready
to assist Chara's fleet!

00:05:36.300 --> 00:05:39.610
Wouldn't that mean we'd
be fighting in Haman's fleet?!

00:05:39.610 --> 00:05:42.470
Would you prefer that Judau's team
doesn't make it back here?!

00:05:51.310 --> 00:05:55.920
Since that mansion was destroyed,
finding Mineva will be a problem.

00:05:55.920 --> 00:05:59.780
No, I know where she is.
I sense Haman.

00:06:04.580 --> 00:06:07.060
Why are you
still here, Mashymre?

00:06:07.060 --> 00:06:10.450
If I leave, I won't be able
to protect you, Lady Haman.

00:06:10.450 --> 00:06:12.500
The Argama won't make the first move.

00:06:12.500 --> 00:06:13.670
Worry about Glemy.

00:06:13.670 --> 00:06:16.550
Your duty is to eliminate the
threat that stands before you.

00:06:16.550 --> 00:06:19.470
Y-Yes, Lady Haman.

00:06:20.110 --> 00:06:24.620
A new rose.
I give this rose to you.

00:06:24.620 --> 00:06:28.190
Your duty is to fight
for this flower, is it not?

00:06:28.190 --> 00:06:30.060
Yes, of course!

00:06:30.250 --> 00:06:32.590
Good. I've given this rose...

00:06:32.590 --> 00:06:36.250
the scent of my skin
and my life's breath.

00:06:36.250 --> 00:06:38.500
I say this to you now:
go forth.

00:06:38.500 --> 00:06:40.080
My lady!

00:06:42.750 --> 00:06:44.300
Yes?

00:06:44.300 --> 00:06:46.440
As you can see, it seems
he's been over-enhanced.

00:06:46.440 --> 00:06:48.010
Keep an eye on him.

00:06:48.010 --> 00:06:49.580
Yes, Lady Haman.

00:06:50.800 --> 00:06:51.870
What?!

00:06:51.870 --> 00:06:54.660
Yes, ma'am! Our spy
at Granada reports that...

00:06:54.660 --> 00:06:57.880
the Federation Forces have
begun moving toward Side 3.

00:06:58.050 --> 00:07:00.320
- What's their strength?
- We don't know yet.

00:07:00.320 --> 00:07:03.430
- Then find out at once!
- Y-Yes, ma'am!

00:07:03.660 --> 00:07:06.100
How is the battle going
battle between Chara and Glemy?!

00:07:08.480 --> 00:07:10.250
Just aim for that
power substation.

00:07:10.250 --> 00:07:11.450
I know that!

00:07:20.160 --> 00:07:21.260
What happened?

00:07:21.260 --> 00:07:24.080
Power failure. We've automatically
switched to the emergency system.

00:07:24.080 --> 00:07:26.510
I'm asking you what
caused the power failure!

00:07:26.510 --> 00:07:28.660
Message from our guards.

00:07:28.660 --> 00:07:31.380
There seems to have been an
attack on a substation in A block.

00:07:31.380 --> 00:07:33.890
Remnants of the Cicero rebels?

00:07:33.890 --> 00:07:36.190
No, it might be guerrillas
sent by Glemy!

00:07:36.190 --> 00:07:37.880
- Check it out, at once!
- Yes, ma'am!

00:07:38.940 --> 00:07:40.720
I don't like this feeling.

00:07:44.690 --> 00:07:47.400
Master Mashymre, we should
have launched already!

00:07:47.400 --> 00:07:49.350
I'm worried about
this power failure.

00:07:49.350 --> 00:07:51.350
We'll leave after I patrol Core 3!

00:07:51.350 --> 00:07:53.060
Then take me with you!

00:07:53.060 --> 00:07:55.740
I can't let you face danger
on your own, Master Mashymre!

00:07:55.740 --> 00:07:59.310
Hm... that's adorable.
Very well, you may attend me.

00:07:59.310 --> 00:08:00.460
Right!

00:08:03.630 --> 00:08:05.680
- Another Zaku?
- Judau!

00:08:05.680 --> 00:08:06.800
Right!

00:08:15.880 --> 00:08:17.100
Okay?

00:08:17.100 --> 00:08:18.560
Leave it to me.

00:08:18.560 --> 00:08:20.400
I did this all the
time at Shangri-La.

00:08:20.400 --> 00:08:23.730
- Don't be proud of it!
- Hush!

00:08:24.780 --> 00:08:26.090
See?

00:08:26.090 --> 00:08:28.540
Nice, you ex-delinquent!

00:08:28.540 --> 00:08:30.830
I wasn't a delinquent!

00:08:32.760 --> 00:08:34.830
Please don't cry.

00:08:35.760 --> 00:08:38.920
Haman. Where's Haman?

00:08:38.920 --> 00:08:42.090
I'll call for her at once.

00:08:47.840 --> 00:08:49.260
That's a little kid.

00:08:49.260 --> 00:08:50.730
It must be Mineva.

00:08:50.730 --> 00:08:53.480
Mashymre is still in Core 3?!

00:08:54.560 --> 00:08:56.830
- Lady Haman!
- Hey, stay out!

00:08:56.830 --> 00:08:59.810
Please, let me speak
with Lady Haman!

00:08:59.810 --> 00:09:00.960
What is it?

00:09:00.960 --> 00:09:03.610
Princess Mineva is distraught
at being left alone.

00:09:03.610 --> 00:09:04.670
Please, go see her.

00:09:04.670 --> 00:09:07.210
You left Princess Mineva by herself?!

00:09:07.210 --> 00:09:08.540
Forgive me!

00:09:08.540 --> 00:09:10.620
Enough, I'll go to her!

00:09:10.620 --> 00:09:13.550
Have Mashymre's team remain
here to guard the residence!

00:09:13.550 --> 00:09:16.350
Tell them that no one is to
leave it without authorization!

00:09:16.350 --> 00:09:17.760
Yes, ma'am!

00:09:17.760 --> 00:09:21.990
There's no mistaking
this sensation. It's Judau!

00:09:21.990 --> 00:09:24.950
I've been focusing
too much on Glemy.

00:09:25.520 --> 00:09:27.360
Hands up!

00:09:30.850 --> 00:09:33.370
Who... who are you?

00:09:33.370 --> 00:09:36.000
- So it was Mineva.
- You're alone?

00:09:36.240 --> 00:09:38.810
They're always
leaving me alone.

00:09:38.810 --> 00:09:42.840
Haman says she cares about me,
but she's really doesn't!

00:09:42.840 --> 00:09:46.180
Don't cry. We came for you.

00:09:46.180 --> 00:09:49.030
Stay with me. Please.

00:09:49.030 --> 00:09:52.620
She may be the heir to Zeon,
but she's still just a child.

00:09:52.620 --> 00:09:56.240
A regular kid. Really.

00:09:58.050 --> 00:10:00.310
Roux, hurry!

00:10:00.310 --> 00:10:01.250
Judau!

00:10:01.250 --> 00:10:03.720
Just go! Hurry!

00:10:03.720 --> 00:10:06.670
Judau Ashta.
I thought it was you.

00:10:06.670 --> 00:10:07.410
Haman!

00:10:07.410 --> 00:10:10.930
Damn you,
at a time like this...!

00:10:13.160 --> 00:10:14.200
What?

00:10:18.370 --> 00:10:19.820
Aren't you full of spirit?

00:10:19.820 --> 00:10:22.090
It's my best quality, Miss Haman.

00:10:22.670 --> 00:10:27.390
Return Princess Mineva at once,
and I'll let you leave Core 3 unharmed.

00:10:27.390 --> 00:10:29.700
Don't tell me an obvious lie!

00:10:29.700 --> 00:10:32.800
I have enough to worry about,
trying to subdue Glemy!

00:10:32.800 --> 00:10:35.450
All the more reason
I won't give you Mineva!

00:10:35.450 --> 00:10:37.200
I'm not wasting this chance!

00:10:37.200 --> 00:10:40.740
Don't you understand
how dangerous Glemy is?

00:10:40.740 --> 00:10:43.840
He's trying to
revive the old Zeon!

00:10:43.840 --> 00:10:45.910
So are you!

00:10:45.910 --> 00:10:50.570
I want to use Princess Mineva, and the
Zeon bloodline, to get back at the Zabi family.

00:10:51.130 --> 00:10:55.450
But Glemy wants to rule space
by the power of blood alone!

00:10:55.450 --> 00:10:57.890
He's a man who would spill
blood across the cosmos!

00:10:57.890 --> 00:11:00.090
You, of all people,
should understand!

00:11:00.090 --> 00:11:01.340
I do, Haman.

00:11:01.340 --> 00:11:04.420
But you'll just end up doing
exactly the same thing!

00:11:06.450 --> 00:11:08.190
Judau, you're wrong!

00:11:08.190 --> 00:11:11.470
It'll be the exact same result.
That's what I understand.

00:11:11.700 --> 00:11:12.990
Judau!

00:11:18.560 --> 00:11:19.180
Who's there!

00:11:19.410 --> 00:11:23.350
Stay back, or I'll kill Mineva!
Drop your gun!

00:11:23.630 --> 00:11:24.940
Princess Mineva!

00:11:27.040 --> 00:11:30.090
What's going on?
Those soldiers over there...

00:11:30.090 --> 00:11:31.600
Princess Mineva!

00:11:32.070 --> 00:11:35.760
Master Mashymre, don't!
Princess Mineva will be killed!

00:11:35.760 --> 00:11:36.410
I know...

00:11:36.650 --> 00:11:40.230
Mobile suits!
One more step, and I'll shoot!

00:11:40.230 --> 00:11:42.750
I'm sorry. I won't shoot you.
Don't be scared.

00:11:42.750 --> 00:11:45.200
All right. I trust you.

00:11:45.200 --> 00:11:45.750
Roux!

00:11:45.950 --> 00:11:49.020
She said any resistance
and we kill Mineva!

00:11:49.520 --> 00:11:50.970
Judau Ashta!

00:11:51.530 --> 00:11:54.130
Mashymre, wait!

00:11:54.130 --> 00:11:55.600
Lady Haman!

00:12:14.800 --> 00:12:18.280
If you escape in that,
I'll shoot you down.

00:12:18.530 --> 00:12:21.450
Don't you care what happens
to your precious Mineva?!

00:12:22.470 --> 00:12:25.710
I'll kill her before
I let you take her.

00:12:25.710 --> 00:12:28.000
I don't want her to suffer.

00:12:28.170 --> 00:12:29.710
Haman...!

00:12:30.170 --> 00:12:34.550
Return Princess Mineva, and
I guarantee your lives.

00:12:34.550 --> 00:12:37.930
If you're going to kill them,
then kill me with them, Haman!

00:12:37.930 --> 00:12:40.020
Mineva!

00:12:40.020 --> 00:12:46.150
You can't criticize me for using
Mineva Zabi anymore, can you, Judau?

00:12:48.120 --> 00:12:51.240
- Judau!
- Stop it! I don't want to stay!

00:12:51.240 --> 00:12:52.860
Haman's serious!

00:12:52.860 --> 00:12:57.340
I'd rather trust Haman's words
than get us all killed here!

00:12:57.340 --> 00:12:59.700
- But...
- No! Take me with you!

00:13:00.470 --> 00:13:02.910
Don't drag me down for now.

00:13:02.910 --> 00:13:04.460
I figured.

00:13:04.460 --> 00:13:07.420
Let them go!
Don't disgrace my honor!

00:13:07.420 --> 00:13:08.790
But, Lady Haman...!

00:13:10.850 --> 00:13:13.760
But you'll never get
out of this colony, Judau!

00:13:19.240 --> 00:13:20.510
Lady Haman!

00:13:20.510 --> 00:13:21.600
Right! After them!

00:13:21.600 --> 00:13:22.470
My lady!

00:13:25.740 --> 00:13:27.830
Seal the port gates at once!

00:13:27.830 --> 00:13:30.570
Sent a Base Jabber
team in pursuit!

00:13:38.800 --> 00:13:41.160
- Roux, the hatch!
- I'll try to make it!

00:13:45.260 --> 00:13:47.000
The hatch!

00:13:48.680 --> 00:13:51.290
Dammit!
Open the hatch, at once!

00:13:55.820 --> 00:13:59.300
The battle's starting! We have to
let the Argama know we've escaped!

00:14:13.830 --> 00:14:16.070
Doven Wolf team,
moving out!

00:14:34.560 --> 00:14:39.150
Rakan, if the Double Zeta appears,
let me have it! You hear me?!

00:14:39.150 --> 00:14:41.430
I hear you, little girl.

00:14:47.910 --> 00:14:50.190
Deputy Captain, we've picked
up a coded signal...

00:14:50.190 --> 00:14:54.020
saying the AEUG and Federation Forces
fleets are heading for Side 3!

00:14:54.540 --> 00:14:58.030
So once Judau and Roux
get back, everything's perfect!

00:14:58.030 --> 00:15:00.320
Captain Bright,
just a little longer.

00:15:00.320 --> 00:15:02.200
Nahel Argama,
form a warning line!

00:15:02.920 --> 00:15:06.200
Beecha Oleg!
Hyaku Shiki, moving out!

00:15:06.930 --> 00:15:09.290
Mega Rider, moving out!

00:15:09.720 --> 00:15:11.710
Mk. II, here I go!

00:15:18.110 --> 00:15:21.050
Reading heat sources moving in
the Nahel Argama's airspace!

00:15:21.050 --> 00:15:23.900
The Argama is moving
against us, too?!

00:15:23.900 --> 00:15:26.850
Leave Chara Soon's fleet to Rakan!

00:15:26.850 --> 00:15:31.310
Our ship will clear out the Nahel Argama's
sector and then approach Core 3!

00:15:39.290 --> 00:15:43.160
Glemy's side's taking new action!
They're headed this way!

00:15:43.160 --> 00:15:45.910
I confirm here, too!
What do we do?!

00:15:45.910 --> 00:15:48.540
We'll move out in front!
We can hit them with these three units!

00:15:48.790 --> 00:15:51.210
I guess...
Here they come!

00:15:54.600 --> 00:15:57.340
I'm getting bad vibes from
the Nahel Argama's sector.

00:16:00.400 --> 00:16:01.970
Roux, run for it!

00:16:05.820 --> 00:16:07.760
There they are!

00:16:07.760 --> 00:16:11.060
The ones who threatened Princess
Mineva and bothered Lady Haman!

00:16:13.450 --> 00:16:16.440
Mashymre...
he's running on a high!

00:16:20.540 --> 00:16:24.780
Hit them! Hit them!
Sink that pseudo-Argama already!

00:16:28.450 --> 00:16:31.420
Where are you, Double Zeta?

00:16:31.420 --> 00:16:36.200
Glemy's ship.
He's hitting the Nahel Argama first?

00:16:36.200 --> 00:16:39.630
While Judau isn't there,
this is such a chore.

00:16:40.690 --> 00:16:42.720
- Move.
- This is crazy!

00:16:42.720 --> 00:16:47.140
Without the La Vie en Rose as a barrier,
what happens to the Nahel Argama?

00:16:47.140 --> 00:16:49.970
That's why we're here
with the Argama, right?

00:16:53.700 --> 00:16:55.270
You'll die!

00:16:55.270 --> 00:16:58.650
I have a duty that was given
to me by Captain Bright!

00:16:58.650 --> 00:17:01.320
All hands, abandon ship!
Get to the Argama!

00:17:01.570 --> 00:17:03.490
What about you?!

00:17:03.490 --> 00:17:06.280
I'll leave last.

00:17:10.760 --> 00:17:14.040
Never mind this!
Judau, get to the Nahel Argama!

00:17:14.600 --> 00:17:17.710
Sorry. Don't die, Roux!

00:17:17.710 --> 00:17:21.750
Of course I won't!
I still have lots to do!

00:17:21.750 --> 00:17:23.920
Sorry.

00:17:30.030 --> 00:17:33.810
They've ceased fire.
Does that mean they're coming now?

00:17:34.830 --> 00:17:36.100
There's the detonation system...

00:17:36.270 --> 00:17:38.350
Deputy Captain, we'll come back!

00:17:38.350 --> 00:17:41.150
No! Where are Milly
and the others?

00:17:41.150 --> 00:17:43.820
Standing by
aboard another launch.

00:17:46.670 --> 00:17:47.910
Get out of here!

00:17:47.910 --> 00:17:48.860
Aye, aye!

00:17:48.860 --> 00:17:49.990
Mobile suits!

00:17:52.910 --> 00:17:53.870
What's...?!

00:17:53.870 --> 00:17:56.080
That's no ship!
It might be a mobile suit!

00:17:56.080 --> 00:17:57.160
Not good!

00:18:01.440 --> 00:18:02.350
Incoming!

00:18:02.350 --> 00:18:04.880
There's only one enemy!

00:18:14.120 --> 00:18:15.560
Get away! Zigzag!

00:18:15.560 --> 00:18:17.520
La Vie en Rose, retreat!

00:18:17.520 --> 00:18:19.810
The La Vie en Rose
will be your shield!

00:18:19.810 --> 00:18:20.900
Miss Emary!

00:18:23.830 --> 00:18:26.440
Just as I sensed!
The Double Zeta isn't here!

00:18:28.880 --> 00:18:31.570
Showing your back
to the La Vie en Rose?!

00:18:46.230 --> 00:18:47.470
How dare you!

00:18:47.470 --> 00:18:50.760
You think you can stop the Quin
Mantha by throwing things at it?!

00:18:52.640 --> 00:18:54.510
Ah! It's passing us!

00:18:56.070 --> 00:18:57.810
Mondo, Beecha, after it!

00:18:57.810 --> 00:18:58.810
Roger!

00:19:01.700 --> 00:19:03.900
Give covering fire to
the La Vie en Rose!

00:19:07.250 --> 00:19:10.240
Captain Bright...
please protect me!

00:19:18.430 --> 00:19:21.290
This isn't child's play!

00:19:30.020 --> 00:19:31.590
That oversized one!

00:19:36.660 --> 00:19:39.350
Argama, retreat, full speed!
Launch dummies!

00:19:39.350 --> 00:19:40.180
Coward!

00:19:45.710 --> 00:19:48.320
BRIGHT!

00:20:06.020 --> 00:20:07.800
Damn it, Ple-Two!

00:20:09.380 --> 00:20:11.880
You're being deceived!

00:20:11.880 --> 00:20:14.510
Remember Ple!
Remember your sister!

00:20:16.240 --> 00:20:18.430
Double Zeta... Judau!

00:20:18.430 --> 00:20:22.100
You're just being used, Ple-Two.
Do you want to be a puppet?!

00:20:22.100 --> 00:20:23.440
Puppet?

00:20:23.440 --> 00:20:26.980
That's right.
During your long sleep,

00:20:26.980 --> 00:20:28.980
you were remade into a puppet...

00:20:28.980 --> 00:20:32.280
that does the bidding of others.
Why can't you see that?!

00:20:32.280 --> 00:20:34.110
I'm a puppet?

00:20:34.110 --> 00:20:37.380
How else could a
little girl be a soldier?!

00:20:37.380 --> 00:20:41.250
It's a lie. A lie.
A LIE!

00:20:43.930 --> 00:20:46.210
Ple-Two... she ran away.

00:20:46.600 --> 00:20:49.920
The others...
are they okay?!

00:20:59.410 --> 00:21:02.060
It can't be true.
I'm me!

00:21:04.370 --> 00:21:09.440
But they did have me in
cold sleep for a long time.

00:21:17.760 --> 00:21:19.200
Enemy reinforcements?

00:21:21.800 --> 00:21:23.580
You dare interfere?!

00:21:24.930 --> 00:21:26.420
Master Mashymre!

00:21:26.420 --> 00:21:28.630
Taking on two at once puts
you at a disadvantage!

00:21:29.270 --> 00:21:32.710
Mashymre!
Admire the scent of your rose.

00:21:32.710 --> 00:21:35.010
The scent of the rose.

00:21:36.610 --> 00:21:38.300
I see.

00:21:38.940 --> 00:21:41.680
They enhanced him too much.

00:21:52.330 --> 00:21:53.980
Miss Emary!

00:21:55.290 --> 00:21:59.280
Deputy Captain, you did
your duty brilliantly!

00:21:59.280 --> 00:22:02.200
Captain Bright could do no better.

00:22:03.300 --> 00:22:06.790
Judau! Miss Emary was...

00:22:08.350 --> 00:22:10.790
Miss Emary.

00:22:16.980 --> 00:22:20.470
Forgive me
for not being there in time.

00:22:44.540 --> 00:22:50.820
<i>ikuyaku ikuman ikuoku no hoshi yo
Hundreds upon thousands upon millions of stars...</i>

00:22:50.820 --> 00:22:56.950
<i>naze hikaru dake nano ka kataru chikara no shiwase
...why do you just sit there and twinkle? Show me the power that lets me connect!</i>

00:22:56.950 --> 00:23:08.050
<i>Ima nara ore demo furikaerasu ni tobitatsu kokoro
For now, even I've got a mind that wanders without reminiscing past regrets!</i>

00:23:08.940 --> 00:23:13.930
<i>Hoshi no kazu dake inochi wo takuwareba
If lives are really stored in the form of stars...</i>

00:23:14.950 --> 00:23:19.940
<i>ginga no mure no hikari wo kaete misero
...show me how to change the light and move galaxies...</i>

00:23:20.620 --> 00:23:29.650
<i>kono te ga tsukamu inochi no omosa ni naru
The weight of life itself, will be held in my hands!</i>

00:23:29.650 --> 00:23:35.530
<i>mada meinai yo sora no michishirude wa
Space's guidepost is still not within my sights...</i>

00:23:35.530 --> 00:23:41.620
<i>kono te ni saware hikari isenmanen
Let the light of 10 million years touch this hand!</i>

00:23:46.470 --> 00:23:51.040
As Mashymre joins the fray,
the final battle begins in earnest.

00:23:51.040 --> 00:23:55.710
Ple-Two is still under Glemy's control,
while Rakan and Chara clash!

00:23:55.880 --> 00:23:59.630
An overly enhanced Mashymre seems
to have a problem somewhere.

00:23:59.630 --> 00:24:03.760
Haman's methods give birth
to yet another tragedy.

00:24:03.760 --> 00:24:07.770
Next time, on Gundam ZZ:
"The Battle of Axis."

00:24:05.720 --> 00:24:08.850
Next Time

00:24:05.720 --> 00:24:08.850
THE BATTLE OF AXIS

00:24:08.400 --> 00:24:10.020
Poor guy.
